    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a character encoded in LLVM&apos;s Char6 encoding. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This format is suitable for encoding decimal numbers (without signs or exponents) and C identifiers (without dollar signs), but not much else.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ulink url="http://llvm.org/docs/BitCodeFormat.html#char6-encoded-value">http://llvm.org/docs/BitCodeFormat.html#char6-encoded-value</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
